000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. IDDIV3.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  NUM         PIC 99.
000060 01  ANSWER      PIC 9(8).
000070 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000080     PERFORM VARYING NUM FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NUM > 8
000090         CALL "IDDIV3FACT" USING NUM ANSWER
000100         DISPLAY NUM "! = " ANSWER
000110     END-PERFORM
000120     STOP RUN.
000130 END PROGRAM IDDIV3.
000140 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000150 PROGRAM-ID. IDDIV3FACT IS RECURSIVE.
000160 DATA DIVISION.
000170 LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
000180 01  SMALLER     PIC 99.
000190 01  SUB-ANSWER  PIC 9(8).
000200 LINKAGE SECTION.
000210 01  N           PIC 99.
000220 01  RESULT      PIC 9(8).
000230 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING N RESULT.
000240     IF N <= 1
000250         MOVE 1 TO RESULT
000260     ELSE
000270         COMPUTE SMALLER = N - 1
000280         CALL "IDDIV3FACT" USING SMALLER SUB-ANSWER
000290         COMPUTE RESULT = N * SUB-ANSWER
000300     END-IF
000310     GOBACK.
000320 END PROGRAM IDDIV3FACT.
